        "original_id": "dbd8328b-2b40-5bb0-82c7-2f65292f3844",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Band: AFI\n- People: Davey Havok, Adam Carson, Hunter Burgan, Jade Puget\n- Place: Ukiah, California\n- Discography: studio albums, live albums, compilation albums, video albums, extended plays, singles, music videos\n\nFacts:\n- AFI, short for A Fire Inside, is an American rock band from Ukiah, California, formed in 1991.\n- Since 1998, AFI has had the same lineup: lead vocalist Davey Havok, drummer and backup vocalist Adam Carson, bassist Hunter Burgan, and guitarist Jade Puget.\n- Hunter Burgan and Jade Puget both also play keyboard and contribute backup vocals in AFI.\n- AFI's discography consists of ten studio albums, one live album, one compilation album, one video album, twelve extended plays, nineteen singles, and fourteen music videos.",
